{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mat-15-1","title":"Matthew 15:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ reproves the Scribes and Pharisees for transgressing God's commandments through their own traditions; 10 teaches how that which goes into the mouth does not defile a man. 21 He heals the daughter of the woman of Canaan, 29 and other great multitudes; 32 and with seven loaves and a few little fishes feeds four thousand men, beside women and children.</p>\n<p>came. Mr 7:1-13 scribes. 5:20; 23:2,15-28; Lu 5:30; Ac 23:9 which. Lu 5:17,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-2","title":"Matthew 15:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>transgress. Mr 7:2,5; Ge 1:14; Col 2:8,20-23; 1Pe 1:18 tradition.Tradition, in Latin {traditio,} from {trado,} I deliver, hand down, exactly agreeing with the original [paradosis ,] from [paradidomi ,] I deliver, transmit. Among the Jews it signifies what is called oral law, which they say has been successively handed down from Moses, through every generation, to Judah the Holy, who compiled and digested it into the Mishneh, to explain which the two Gemaras, or Talmuds, called the Jerusalem and Babylonish, were composed. Of the estimation in which these were held by the Jews, the following may serve as an example: \"The words of the Scribes are lovely beyond the words of the law, for the words of the law are weighty and light, but the words of the Scribes are all weighty.\"</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-3","title":"Matthew 15:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Why. 7:3-5; Mr 7:6-8,13; Col 2:8,23; Tit 1:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-4","title":"Matthew 15:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>God. 4:10; 5:17-19; Isa 8:20; Ro 3:31 Honour. 19:19; Ex 20:12; Le 19:3; De 5:16; Pr 23:22; Eph 6:1 He. Ex 21:17; Le 20:9; De 21:18-21; 27:16; Pr 20:20; 30:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-5","title":"Matthew 15:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>ye say. 23:16-18; Am 7:15-17; Mr 7:10-13; Ac 4:19; 5:29 It is. Le 27:9-34; Pr 20:25; Mr 7:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-6","title":"Matthew 15:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>honour. 1Ti 5:3,4,8,16 Thus. Ps 119:126,139; Jer 8:8; Ho 4:6; Mal 2:7-9; Mr 7:13; Ro 3:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-7","title":"Matthew 15:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>hypocrites. 7:5; 23:23-29 well. Mr 7:6; Ac 28:25-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-8","title":"Matthew 15:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>draweth. Isa 29:13; Eze 33:31; Joh 1:47; 1Pe 3:10 but. Pr 23:26; Jer 12:2; Ac 8:21; Heb 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-9","title":"Matthew 15:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>in. Ex 20:7; Le 26:16,20; 1Sa 25:21; Ps 39:6; 73:13; Ec 5:2-7 Isa 1:13-15; 58:1-3; Mal 3:14; Mr 7:7; 1Co 15:2; Jas 2:20 teaching. De 12:32; Pr 30:5,6; Isa 29:13; Col 2:18-22; 1Ti 1:4; 4:1-3,6,7 Tit 1:14; Heb 13:9; Re 22:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-10","title":"Matthew 15:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>he. 1Ki 22:28; Mr 7:14,16; Lu 20:45-47 Hear. 13:19; 24:15; Isa 6:9; 55:3; Lu 24:45; Eph 1:17; Col 1:9; Jas 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-11","title":"Matthew 15:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>that which goeth. Mr 7:15; Lu 11:38-41; Ac 10:14,15; 11:8,9; Ro 14:14,17,20 1Ti 4:4,5; Tit 1:15; Heb 13:9 but. 18-20; 12:34-37; Ps 10:7; 12:2; 52:2-4; 58:3,4; Isa 37:23 Isa 59:3-5,13-15; Jer 9:3-6; Ro 3:13,14; Jas 3:5-8; 2Pe 2:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-12","title":"Matthew 15:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Knowest. 17:27; 1Ki 22:13,14; 1Co 10:32,33; 2Co 6:3; Ga 2:5; Jas 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-13","title":"Matthew 15:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Every. 13:40,41; Ps 92:13; Isa 60:21; Joh 15:2,6; 1Co 3:12-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-14","title":"Matthew 15:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Let. Ho 4:17; 1Ti 6:5 they. 23:16-24; Isa 9:16; 42:19; 56:10; Mal 2:8; Lu 6:39 And if. Jer 5:31; 6:15; 8:12; Eze 14:9,10; Mic 3:6,7; 2Pe 2:1,17; Re 19:20 Re 22:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-15","title":"Matthew 15:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Declare. 13:36; Mr 4:34; 7:17; Joh 16:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-16","title":"Matthew 15:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>10; 13:51; 16:9,11; Isa 28:9,10; Mr 6:52; 7:18; 8:17,18; 9:32; Lu 9:45 Lu 18:34; 24:45; Heb 5:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-17","title":"Matthew 15:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>that. 7:19,20; Lu 6:45; 1Co 6:13; Col 2:21,22; Jas 3:6 and is. 2Ki 10:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-18","title":"Matthew 15:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>11; 12:34; 1Sa 24:13; Ps 36:3; Pr 6:12; 10:32; 15:2,28; Lu 19:22 Jas 3:6-10; Re 13:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-19","title":"Matthew 15:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>out. Ge 6:5; 8:21; Pr 4:23; 6:14; 22:15; 24:9; Jer 17:9; Mr 7:21-23 Ro 3:10-19; 7:18; 8:7,8; Ga 5:19-21; Eph 2:1-3; Tit 3:2-6 evil. 9:4; Ps 119:113; Isa 55:7; 59:7; Jer 4:14; Ac 8:22; Jas 1:13-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-20","title":"Matthew 15:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>which. 1Co 3:16,17; 6:9-11,18-20; Eph 5:3-6; Re 21:8,27 but. 2; 23:25,26; Mr 7:3,4; Lu 11:38-40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-21","title":"Matthew 15:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>and departed. Mr 7:24 Tyre. 10:5,6; 11:21-23; Ge 49:13; Jos 11:8; 13:6; 19:28,29; Jud 1:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-22","title":"Matthew 15:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>a woman. 3:8,9; Ps 45:12; Eze 3:6; Mr 7:26 Have. 9:27; 17:15; Ps 4:1; 6:2; Lu 17:13; 18:13 son. 1:1; 20:30,31; 22:42-45; Lu 18:38,39; Joh 7:41,42 my. 17:15; Mr 7:25; 9:17-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-23","title":"Matthew 15:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Ge 42:7; De 8:2; Ps 28:1; La 3:8 Send. 14:15; Mr 10:47,48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-24","title":"Matthew 15:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>I am not. 9:36; 10:5,6; Isa 53:6; Jer 50:6,7; Eze 34:5,6,16,23; Lu 15:4-6 Ac 3:25,26; 13:46; Ro 15:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-25","title":"Matthew 15:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>came. 20:31; Ge 32:26; Ho 12:4; Lu 11:8-10; 18:1-8 worshipped. 14:33 Lord. Mr 9:22,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-26","title":"Matthew 15:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>It is not. 7:6; Mr 7:27,28; Ac 22:21,22; Ro 9:4; Ga 2:15; Eph 2:12; Php 3:2 Re 22:15 dogs.[Tois kunarion ,] \"to the little dogs,\" lap dogs, etc., the diminutive of [kuon ,] a dog. The Jews, while they boasted of being the children of God, gave the name of dogs to the heathen, for their idolatry, etc.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-27","title":"Matthew 15:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Truth. 8:8; Ge 32:10; Job 40:4,5; 42:2-6; Ps 51:4,5; Eze 16:63; Da 9:18 Lu 7:6,7; 15:18,19; 18:13; 23:40-42; Ro 3:4,19; 1Co 15:8,9 1Ti 1:13-15 yet. 5:45; Lu 16:21; Ro 3:29; 10:12; Eph 3:8,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-28","title":"Matthew 15:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Jesus. Job 13:15; 23:10; La 3:32 O woman.Our Lord's purpose being now answered, he openly commended her faith, and assured her that her daughter was healed.</p>\n<p>great. 8:10; 14:31; 1Sa 2:30; Lu 17:5; Ro 4:19,20; 2Th 1:3 be it. 8:13; 9:29,30; Ps 145:19; Mr 5:34; 7:29,30; 9:23,24; Lu 7:9,50 Lu 18:42,43; Joh 4:50-53</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-29","title":"Matthew 15:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>and came. Mr 7:31 unto. 4:18; Jos 12:3 Chinneroth. Isa 9:1; Mr 1:16; Lu 5:1 lake of Gennesaret. Joh 6:1,23; 21:1 Tiberias. went. 5:1; 13:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-30","title":"Matthew 15:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>great. 4:23,24; 11:4,5; 14:35,36; Ps 103:3; Isa 35:5,6; Mr 1:32-34 Mr 6:54-56; Lu 6:17-19; 7:21,22; Ac 2:22; 5:15,16; 19:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-31","title":"Matthew 15:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>the dumb. 9:33; Mr 7:37 the maimed. 18:8; Mr 9:43; Lu 14:13,21 the lame. 21:14; Ac 3:2-11; 14:8-10 and they. 9:8; Ps 50:15,23; Mr 2:12; Lu 7:16; 17:15-18; 18:43; Joh 9:24 God. Ge 32:28; 33:20; *marg: Ex 24:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-32","title":"Matthew 15:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>Jesus. 9:36; 14:14; 20:34; Mr 8:1,2; 9:22; Lu 7:13 I have. Heb 4:15 three. 12:40; 27:63; Ac 27:33 and have. 6:32,33; Lu 12:29,30 lest. 1Sa 14:28-31; 30:11,12; Mr 8:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-33","title":"Matthew 15:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>Whence. Nu 11:21,22; 2Ki 4:42-44; Mr 6:37; 8:4,5; Joh 6:5-7 to fill. 14:15; Lu 9:13; Joh 6:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-34","title":"Matthew 15:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>How. 16:9,10 few. Lu 24:41,42; Joh 21:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-35","title":"Matthew 15:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>to sit. 14:19-21; Mr 6:39,40; Lu 9:14-16; Joh 6:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-36","title":"Matthew 15:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>and gave thanks. 26:26,27; 1Sa 9:13; Lu 22:19; 24:30; Joh 6:11; Ac 27:35; Ro 14:6 1Co 10:31; 1Ti 4:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-37","title":"Matthew 15:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>all. 33; 14:20,21; Ps 107:9; Lu 1:53 seven. 16:9,10; Mr 8:8,9,19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-15-39","title":"Matthew 15:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>he sent. 14:22; Mr 8:10</p>"}]}